   "firstAppearance": "s1",
   "summary": "First mention: “Valentin had learned by his inquiries that morning that a Father Brown from Essex was bringing up a silver cross with sapphires, a relic of considerable value, to show some of the foreign priests at the congress.”"
  },
  {
