   "name": "Valentin",
   "role": "major",
   "firstAppearance": "s1",
   "summary": "First mention: “For this was Valentin himself, the head of the Paris police and the most famous investigator of the world; and he was coming from Brussels to London to make the greatest arrest of the century.”"
  },
