   "name": "Welkin",
   "role": "minor",
   "firstAppearance": "s5",
   "summary": "First mention: ““Smythe’s first letter was simply to say that he had started out walking with Welkin to London; but Welkin was such a good walker that the little man dropped out of it, and took a rest by the roadside.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "atkinson",
   "name": "Atkinson",
   "role": "minor",
   "firstAppearance": "s7",
   "summary": "First mention: “Atkinson can’t get in, because I locked the door.””"
  },
  {
   "id": "craven",
   "name": "Craven",
   "role": "minor",
   "firstAppearance": "s6",
   "summary": "First mention: ““We must get a candle,” said Craven, suddenly.”"
  },
  {
